() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RFID Not Detected) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Hold the card closer to the RFID reader.) Tj
T*
(- Wait for upload/sync to finish.) Tj
T*
(- Try scanning again.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
