T*
() Tj
T*
(- Wait for the loading popup to close.) Tj
T*
(- If cloud read fails, the device should fall back safely.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Rep Not Counted) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Use full range of motion.) Tj
T*
(- Move smoothly.) Tj
T*
(- Reach the top and bottom positions.) Tj
T*
(- Recalibrate if ROM mapping looks wrong.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
